<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13317" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονοστ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>return, come home,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> in phrase 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂψ ἀπονοστήσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.60
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀπὸ τάφου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					735
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὀπίσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. σῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.124
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				4.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπήμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.42
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς Σπάρτην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.82
				</span></i>
			; rare in Trag. and Prose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπονοστήσας χθονός</span>”
				<i>when he returns from . .,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					731
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπ᾽ οἴκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.87
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Protr.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ί</span>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.5.16
			</span></i>.</div>
